WEBVTT

00:01.880 --> 00:02.600
<i>I...</i>

00:03.270 --> 00:06.110
<i>Itsuomi-san's place?</i>

00:07.430 --> 00:12.420
<i>Somehow, we ended up 
coming to his place to eat.</i>

00:16.840 --> 00:21.500
Oh, my family's living overseas right now, 
so don't worry about that.

00:21.900 --> 00:26.040
<i>Overseas?! So he lives alone...</i>

00:26.040 --> 00:28.500
<i>My brain's about to short-circuit.</i>

00:28.990 --> 00:32.140
<i>Th-The... The nerves!</i>

02:00.220 --> 02:03.970
The Answer

02:15.550 --> 02:18.780
<i>I've never seen him drinking before.</i>

02:21.460 --> 02:23.700
<i>Stay calm... Stay calm!</i>

02:24.560 --> 02:26.660
Did you have fun today?

02:27.380 --> 02:30.970
<i>I had put the sign for "fun" in the 
Sign Language Guide, but still...</i>

02:31.960 --> 02:34.420
<b></b>I had fun.

02:31.960 --> 02:34.420
<b></b>I had fun.

02:34.280 --> 02:36.670
Great. Same here.

02:40.850 --> 02:42.410
I had fun, too.

02:48.630 --> 02:49.560
<i>Huh?</i>

02:50.080 --> 02:51.640
<i>Itsuomi-san...</i>

02:54.850 --> 02:56.070
<i>He's hugging me?</i>

02:58.610 --> 03:01.860
<i>Oh. He was just grabbing his phone.</i>

03:03.070 --> 03:05.830
Did something happen?

03:03.070 --> 03:05.830
Has anyone ever told you that
spending time with you makes
one sleepy?

03:10.210 --> 03:15.210
Has anyone ever told you that
spending time with you makes
one sleepy?

03:10.830 --> 03:15.210
Nope.

03:11.120 --> 03:12.920
<i>What did he mean by that?</i>

03:16.210 --> 03:19.720
It's just really comfy

03:20.740 --> 03:22.280
<i>Itsuomi-san...</i>

03:23.530 --> 03:26.200
<i>Well, I'm too nervous to be comfy.</i>

03:27.480 --> 03:31.350
<i>If there is such a thing as compatibility 
between people's wavelengths,</i>

03:32.160 --> 03:37.420
<i>I wonder where he and I stand. 
I hope we're compatible.</i>

03:43.320 --> 03:44.970
<i>I caught a glimpse of the screen...</i>

03:45.600 --> 03:47.240
<i>What language is that?</i>

03:48.260 --> 03:51.050
<i>While he seems like he lives 
in a different world,</i>

03:51.050 --> 03:54.280
<i>I'm in his arms right now.</i>

03:55.170 --> 03:59.050
<i>He's wrapping me all up.</i>

04:00.210 --> 04:04.760
<i>Being with him brings out something 
that completely takes over my mind...</i>

04:05.320 --> 04:07.380
<i>The clingy side of me.</i>

04:11.270 --> 04:14.140
Hey, quit hanging on to me.

04:15.030 --> 04:18.870
Here. Mint's favorite toys and other stuff.

04:18.870 --> 04:19.780
Yeah.

04:21.480 --> 04:23.470
Tell your folks I said hi.

04:23.470 --> 04:24.570
Sure.

04:24.570 --> 04:27.030
Mom sounded awfully 
envious of your family trip.

04:27.480 --> 04:29.800
What should I get her as a souvenir?

04:29.800 --> 04:33.540
Don't bother with that crap. 
Just make sure you have a good time.

04:33.540 --> 04:34.550
