04:36.540 --> 04:41.420
I'll be back for you in a couple 
of days, so be good, Mint.

04:49.180 --> 04:49.920
Ow!

04:50.910 --> 04:53.160
Sheesh, I'm such a fool...

04:57.100 --> 04:57.940
