<b></b>Itsuomi-san looks
at you with really
gentle eyes.

18:51.680 --> 18:56.730
<i>Itsuomi-san looks at you 
with really gentle eyes.</i>

18:53.820 --> 18:56.730
<b></b>Itsuomi-san looks
at you with really
gentle eyes.

18:57.360 --> 19:03.740
Isn't he like that
with everyone?

18:59.240 --> 19:03.740
Nope!

19:00.990 --> 19:03.740
Besides...

19:03.780 --> 19:06.490
His voice when
speaking to you was
suuuper affectionate!!

19:16.060 --> 19:20.230
<i>You know, I get really clingy 
when I'm with Itsuomi-san.</i>

19:20.920 --> 19:24.840
<i>Like how the snow from the sky above 
clings to the things it falls on.</i>

19:25.640 --> 19:29.660
<i>But I wonder what I mean to Itsuomi-san.</i>

19:33.970 --> 19:37.030
Whoa, you got here quick! Come in!

19:39.410 --> 19:42.180
<i>Huh? Itsuomi-san?!</i>

19:42.180 --> 19:44.870
I'm gonna go down 
to the corner store real quick!

19:45.130 --> 19:46.870
<i>Where's Rin-chan going?!</i>

20:00.260 --> 20:01.580
Aren't you singing?

20:02.010 --> 20:05.380
I'm not in the mood anymore.

20:06.200 --> 20:08.680
Are you up for drinks, Shin-chan?

20:08.680 --> 20:09.550
Nah.

20:09.550 --> 20:12.240
Huh? You're not drinking?

20:12.240 --> 20:14.520
Are you working on a practice 
model's hair tonight?

20:15.430 --> 20:17.290
Oh...

20:17.290 --> 20:19.130
Something happen with Itsu-kun?

20:19.770 --> 20:21.300
Nothing.

20:22.210 --> 20:25.280
Nothing at all. That's why I'm down.

20:26.530 --> 20:30.130
Emma, you might be trying too hard.

20:30.130 --> 20:31.290
Huh?

20:34.640 --> 20:37.290
How about we go for drinks 
after I'm done with work?

20:37.290 --> 20:38.800
Oh, Shin-chan!

20:39.260 --> 20:41.360
What time do you get off? Down to the second!

20:41.360 --> 20:43.660
At what point in the Earth's rotation?!

20:44.320 --> 20:46.010
What are you, nine?

20:46.800 --> 20:50.760
I called Rin last night, 
figuring something was wrong.

20:50.760 --> 20:52.060
And what do you know?

20:52.380 --> 20:54.620
Why did you leave without me?

20:56.360 --> 20:57.810
Well, it doesn't matter.

21:00.210 --> 21:02.650
Let's pick up where we left off.

21:04.520 --> 21:07.570
<i>Where we left off...</i>

21:08.570 --> 21:16.080
Can I ask you something first?

21:11.080 --> 21:16.080
Why do you want to learn sign language?

21:14.470 --> 21:16.080
"Why"?

21:18.360 --> 21:21.840
Because I want to talk to you, obviously.

21:25.250 --> 21:30.120
<i>No matter what I mean to him,</i>

21:32.520 --> 21:33.420
"Every"...

21:34.600 --> 21:37.610
<i>I want him to let me be the falling snow.</i>

21:39.220 --> 21:42.060
<i>You are my sky.</i>

21:42.790 --> 21:45.620
<i>You don't need to ask how much that covers.</i>

21:47.030 --> 21:48.410
Eve

21:48.660 --> 21:49.820
ry

21:50.280 --> 21:52.580
thing

22:06.010 --> 22:10.010
The Answer

22:07.240 --> 22:08.920
<i>Itsuomi-san.</i>

23:15.030 --> 23:30.260
Always Thought I Wanted to Be



the Watchful Eye Forever
